ied. Usage: /tick sprint Makes the tick speed run as fast as possible for the desired number of…","syntax":"","aliases":["Boreal","Commands"]},{"id":"boreal--repository--readme-md--4e33f68931#overview","documentId":"boreal--repository--readme-md--4e33f68931","projectId":"boreal","projectTitle":"Boreal","repository":"Boreal","kind":"extension","title":"Repository Readme","originalTitle":"Overview","route":"/docs/boreal/repository-readme#overview","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ForestOfLight/Boreal/blob/5a4ee3f16c1a6fd4a8df22680a42248ef1c8d1b8/README.md","sourceType":"repository","documentTitle":"Boreal","sectionTitle":"Overview","headingPath":["Overview"],"snippet":"Boreal GitHub Downloads Minecraft - Version -brightgreen) Discord An Endstone plugin for Technical Minecraft servers, specifically meant to fill in feature gaps in Canopy created by a lack of access in the vanilla Script API for Behavior Packs . Can run standalone, but also integrates with Canopy .","syntax":"","aliases":["Overview","Boreal"]},{"id":"boreal--repository--readme-md--4e33f68931#supported-versions","documentId":"boreal--repository--readme-md--4e33f68931","projectId":"boreal","projectTitle":"Boreal","repository":"Boreal","kind":"feature","title":"Supported Versions","originalTitle":"Supported Versions","route":"/docs/boreal/repository-readme#supported-versions","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ForestOfLight/Boreal/blob/5a4ee3f16c1a6fd4a8df22680a42248ef1c8d1b8/README.md","sourceType":"repository","documentTitle":"Boreal","sectionTitle":"Supported Versions","headingPath":["Supported Versions"],"snippet":"Supported Versions Please use Boreal with its corresponding Minecraft version. Minecraft Version Boreal Version ------------------- ---------------- 1.26.12.2 v0.1.3 1.26.0.2 v0.1.2 1.21.130.3 v0.1.1 1.21.80.3 v0.1.0","syntax":"","aliases":["Boreal"]}]}